e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_lIvVAJsGxIQ7kNvwERKM7e&_nc_oc=Adp7wppO7HObZQYZLnp83Ukh920tBW5BK3zU437Zx_FVryUcT3fVg1w7inJ9tVoXSig&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKLwyppYI_B3bNgG9qAIP4vDSD3exG2wsHI2e3NGIVDPQ&oe=6AAAB0F9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vTj4aFNvJgUQ7kNvwG2APT8&_nc_oc=AdpcinYM0tekEffmGJ7z1SWvqMlvcBoH2tPsQfSZgwW_eAfqfyATNYJLSD35Q6WELDo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKY169NDzzlcXiHYvxzj4qqSr62uOSJgrgom85yHbCPZw&oe=6AAA8853"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fu_YN5UKtmAQ7kNvwFnVnsW&_nc_oc=AdqFgy7o1Hazkzho-wdh6s1MuEZfNOz1KCjdvB212bMd-GSzTSGnteC42VwFwc9M0qg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKGO-Re84jSBnBWzT8ytGnx1MiqTVgveWgOLT0PZZWfaw&oe=6AAA93FB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bT7K6_gOtxMQ7kNvwHP7MXQ&_nc_oc=Ado4MKdb2GYRsS4kg5tX1vSlH-TW7GRuwEFxsdjfhhGz-_8wvLIHbV8V1ZwBzdenSzc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLv25Ua-n8aUi7jchogF4VYNowL-bFwlZdNeXQSHJZr2w&oe=6AAA954A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TcmhL944vqsQ7kNvwFUO9X9&_nc_oc=Adp3ZftSV4B6fNhBfkwUCdxSv7g3GNDUPKJNfDaKaVoOKBCtUo4zkNa1e21gkqT6wZA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJMxWPVC2tC063b1d4MWdEp1-uuWtdfYmrC7bYeRCMHDg&oe=6AAAB6BE"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se